Cell["\<\
The line through the centre of a grid and a vertex two steps up and two \
across. It runs both ways, to the two opposite corners: 2520 lines, each of \
length 16, the diameter of the grid.\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"65429710-d06b-4f60-9521-78bbdf57816f"],

